 directed by your project co-ordinator.", "value": "The quotation has not made any allowance for an external decking, patio or steps leading out to the garden. This can be priced on site direct by either the finishing\u2019s team or foreman as directed by your project co-ordinator."}, "editor_overrides": {}, "flags": {"editor_dirty": false, "source_dirty": false}, "settings": {"alignment": "left", "font_size": 16, "margin_bottom": 2, "margin_top": 2, "padding": 12}, "list_group_id": "list_1", "list_type": "ol", "list_index": 1}, {"id": "form__special_notes_page__special_notes_page__line_items__sn3#", "type": "form_question", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Existing Decking & Fences", "line_code": "sn3#", "output_guidance": "", "output_notes": "Any existing decking and fences will be removed and disposed of as part of the works. If you would like to retain any decking or fences, please arrange for these to be removed and safely stored prior to the commencement of the works.", "value": "Any existing decking and fences will be removed and disposed of as part of the works. If you would like to retain any decking or fences, please arrange for these to be removed and safely stored prior to the commencement of the works."}, "editor_overrides": {}, "flags": {"editor_dirty": false, "source_dirty": false}, "settings": {"alignment": "left", "font_size": 16, "margin_bottom": 2, "margin_top": 2, "padding": 12}, "list_group_id": "list_1", "list_type": "ol", "list_index": 2}, {"id": "form__special_notes_page__special_notes_page__line_items__sn4#", "type": "form_question", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Garden", "line_code": "sn4#", "output_guidance": "*PLEASE NOTE \u2013 THAT IF YOU HAVE SYNTHETIC GRASS WE RECOMMEND THAT IT IS UPLIFTED AND REMOVED PRIOR TO WORKS COMMENCING AS WE CANNOT GUARANTEE IT WILL NOT GET DAMAGED.", "output_notes": "Please be aware that the we will need to use your front & rear garden as a working area for the purpose