tion", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Access Areas & Front Door Re-decorating", "line_code": "sn6#", "output_guidance": "*PLEASE NOTE \u2013 IF YOU HAVE AN OLD LOCKING SYSTEM TO THE FRONT DOOR, THERE IS A POSSIBILITY THAT THIS WILL NEED TO BE REPLACED AT THE END OF THE PROJECT.", "output_notes": "The client will need to budget for redecorating the ground floor hallway, front door and any other area used for access once the building works have been completed. This can be priced for by the finishing team. The company recommends the client take up floor coverings where possible. We will endeavour to protect any non-removable floor coverings but we are not liable for any damage.", "value": "The client will need to budget for redecorating the ground floor hallway, front door and any other area used for access once the building works have been completed. This can be priced for by the finishing team. The company recommends the client take up floor coverings where possible. We will endeavour to protect any non-removable floor coverings but we are not liable for any damage."}, "editor_overrides": {}, "flags": {"editor_dirty": false, "source_dirty": false}, "settings": {"alignment": "left", "font_size": 16, "margin_bottom": 2, "margin_top": 2, "padding": 12}, "list_group_id": "list_1", "list_type": "ol", "list_index": 5}, {"id": "form__special_notes_page__special_notes_page__line_items__sn7#", "type": "form_question", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Original Cornicing", "line_code": "sn7#", "output_guidance": "", "output_notes": "Plus Rooms are not responsible for any damage to existing architrave skirting boards, coving, dado and picture rails or similar. The cost to repair/ replace such items is to be priced directly by the finishing\u2019s team or others.", "value": "Plus Rooms are not responsible for any damage to existing architrave skirting boards, coving, dado and picture rails or similar. The cost to repair/ replace such items is to be priced directly by the finishing\u2019s team or others."}, "editor_overrides": {}, "flags": {"editor_dirty": false, "source_dirty": false}, "settings": {"alignment": "left", "font_size": 16, "margin_bottom": 2, "margin_top": 2, "padding": 12}, "list_group_id": "list_1", "list_type": "ol", "list_index": 6}, {"id": "form__special_notes_page__special_notes_page__line_items__sn8#", "type": "form_question", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Cracking", "line_code": "sn8#", "output_guidance": "", "output_notes": "It is reasonable to assume that cracks will occur when supporting walls are removed and steel beams are inserted. Plus Rooms are responsible for all structural cracking. Cosmetic cracks and hairline cracks that require filling and painting fall under decoration works and can be priced for by the finishings team.", "value": "It is reasonable to assume that cracks will occur when supporting walls are removed and steel beams are inserted. Plus Rooms are responsible for all structural cracking. Cosmetic cracks and hairline cracks that require filling and painting fall under decoration works and can be priced for by the finishings team."}, "editor_overrides": {}, "flags": {"editor_dirty": false, "source_dirty": false}, "settings": {"alignment": "left", "font_size": 16, "margin_bottom": 2, "margin_top": 2, "padding": 12}, "list_group_id": "list_1", "list_type": "ol", "list_index": 7}, {"id": "form__special_notes_page__special_notes_page__line_items__sn9#", "type": "form_question", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Trees, Hedges & Flowers", "line_code": "sn9#", "output_guidance": "", "output_notes": "It\u2019s the client\u2019s responsibility to arrange for any trees and hedges to be removed prior to the building works starting should they be inside or within close proximity to where the building works are to take place. Any flowers or plants not removed will be skipped as part of the demolition.", "value": "It\u2019s the client\u2019s responsibility to arrange for any trees and hedges to be removed prior to the building works starting should they be inside or within close proximity to where the building works are to take place. Any flowers or plants not removed will be skipped as part of the demolition."}, "editor_overrides": {}, "flags": {"editor_dirty": false, "source_dirty": false}, "settings": {"alignment": "left", "font_size": 16, "margin_bottom": 2, "margin_top": 2, "padding": 12}, "list_group_id": "list_1", "list_type": "ol", "list_index": 8}, {"id": "form__special_notes_page__special_notes_page__line_items__sn10#", "type": "form_question", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Gas/Electric Metres", "line_code": "sn10#", "output_guidance": "", "output_notes": "If the gas or/ and the electric metre is positioned in a location where the building works are taking place then it is the clients responsibility to arrange for their suppliers to relocate them.", "value": "If the gas or/ and the electric metre is positioned in a location where the building works are taking place then it is the clients responsibility to arrange for their suppliers to relocate them."}, "editor_overrides": {}, "flags": {"editor_dirty": false, "source_dirty": false}, "settings": {"alignment": "left", "font_size": 16, "margin_bottom": 2, "margin_top": 2, "padding": 12}, "list_group_id": "list_1", "list_type": "ol", "list_index": 9}, {"id": "form__special_notes_page__special_notes_page__line_items__sn11#", "type": "form_question", "snapshot": {"category": "Special Notes", "label": "Facilities", "line_code": "sn11#", "output_guidance": "", "output_notes": "This quotation is based on the understanding that a WC will be made available for the Plus Rooms team throughout the project. If this is not possible then it will be the client\u2019s responsibility to provide a port-a-loo.", "value": "This quotation is based on the understanding that a WC will be made available for the Plus Rooms team throughout 